  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Waqar Manzoor Ansari vs The Sr Inspector And Ors on 11 October, 2023 Author: M. S. Karnik Bench: M. S. Karnik 2023:Bhc-As:30150 Urmila Ingale 8.ba.2592-2 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Bail Application No.2592 Of 2023 Waqar Manzoor Ansari ..Applicant Vs. 1. The Senior Inspector Shantinagar Police Station 2. The State Of Maharashtra ..Respondents Mr. Mateen Shaikh A/W Mr. Razique Shaikh, Arshad Shaikh, Ms. Muskan Shaikh, Mr. Afrin Khan, for the Applicant. Ms. Veera Shinde, App for the State. Asi-M.B. Parab, Crime Branch, Thane, Shantinagar Police Station present. Coram : M. S. Karnik, J. Date : October 11, 2023 P.C. : 1.",
    "facts": "3. There are in all 3 accused. The applicant is the accused no Ingale The applicant was arrested on 06/05/2023. 4. Except section 328 of IPC, all other offences are bailable. The complainant received a secret information of storage of contraband articles at Gaibi Nagar, Gulzar Apartment, Bhiwandi. As per information, police officials formed a team and raid was conducted. The applicant was found at the spot place. On further search, it was found that articles- pan masala and tobacco worth Rs. 8,20,000/- which was recovered. There are no criminal antecedents reported against the applicant. The raid was conducted on 06/05/2023. The investigation is complete. The charge-sheet has been filed. The entire contraband has been seized. The applicant is in custody for more than 5 months. The applicability of section 328 to the contraband - panmasala is pending consideration before the Hon'ble Supreme Court.",
